WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Create a FastAPI application and define routes with decorators.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The GET endpoint at slash health returns a JSON status for service health checks.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Run the application with Uvicorn and open the automatic API documentation.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Pydantic response models validate and document the returned data.
